@AutoSave
[PrintTextModified Text:这个围墙真的好高啊。<br>嗯——，要是能破坏掉就好了……|#0102Adv05_Sherry001| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:第二天，艾玛一行人来到监牢外的<br>围墙前面。|#0102Adv05_Narrative001| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:因为人越多越显眼，<br>这次只有艾玛、雪莉和米莉亚三个人过来这里。|#0102Adv05_Narrative002| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:米莉亚很想帮上大家的忙，<br>所以就兴致勃勃地跟了过来。|#0102Adv05_Narrative003| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:80 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Normal1,ArmR8
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:20 IdAndAppearance:Miria.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:我可以试着再揍一顿吗？|#0102Adv05_Sherry002| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Surprised1

[PrintTextModified Text:不、不行不行不行！<br>会把看守引来的！|#0102Adv05_Ema001| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:为什么破坏不了这堵墙呢？<br>我看也不是用什么特殊材料做的啊。|#0102Adv05_Miria001| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:80 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Pensive1,ArmR1

[PrintTextModified Text:也许是国家的阴谋……<br>或者是其他人施加了魔法。|#0102Adv05_Sherry003| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:嗯……花田上空还一直悬挂着彩虹，<br>这个监牢有许多奇异的地方。|#0102Adv05_Ema002| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我猜，这会不会是之前关押在这里的少女<br>遗留下的魔法。|#0102Adv05_Ema003| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:80 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:如果是这样，那就是说……<br>就算人死了，魔法的效果也永远不会消失。|#0102Adv05_Sherry004| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:因为以前被抓的少女们<br>估计都差不多死光了呢。|#0102Adv05_Sherry005| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:20 IdAndAppearance:Miria.Surprised1

[PrintTextModified Text:不、不要说这么可怕的话啦。|#0102Adv05_Miria002| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:（……说真的，这围墙究竟是怎么一回事……）|#0102Adv05_Ema004| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:正当艾玛陷入沉思的时候，<br>米莉亚和雪莉已经离开围墙走去别处。|#0102Adv05_Narrative004| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:但艾玛还是对这围墙十分在意，<br>于是便再次仔细地观察这堵墙。|#0102Adv05_Narrative005| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:接着，她发现在靠近地面的墙面上<br>刻有一段文字。|#0102Adv05_Narrative006| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:【很久很久以前，大魔女对这堵围墙施加了魔法】|#0102Adv05_Narrative007| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:【那是非常强力的魔法，可让对象不受任何魔法或物理的干涉】|#0102Adv05_Narrative008| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:【大魔女是想保护魔女吗？是为了防止她们受谁的侵害？】|#0102Adv05_Narrative009| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:【我用幻视看到的只有这些。囚犯此记】|#0102Adv05_Narrative010| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:那潦草的笔迹看着像是最近新写的，<br>墨水痕迹还很新。|#0102Adv05_Narrative011| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:（【幻视】……难道是奈叶香写的……？）|#0102Adv05_Ema005| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（大魔女究竟是什么……<br>　这应该是个很重要的信息。记在【魔女图鉴】里吧）|#0102Adv05_Ema006|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

; ========================================
; ☆【魔女図鑑】『エマのメモ２』入手
; ========================================
@SpawnExtended Path:Clue Params:2-1
@UpdateWitchBook Id:9 Category:Note Version:1
@DestroySpawnedExtended Path:Clue LogWarning:true

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛离开围墙，<br>跟上米莉亚和雪莉的脚步。|#0102Adv05_Narrative012| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Miria.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:我们要找监视猫头鹰看不到的地方，对不对。<br>那边怎么样？|#0102Adv05_Miria003| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:看，树林长得又深又茂密，<br>应该有不少监视死角。|#0102Adv05_Miria004| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ＠備考◆こそこそ話風に

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:40 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:60 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Normal1,ArmR6

[PrintTextModified Text:……你对米莉亚是什么看法？|#0102Adv05_Sherry006| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:雪莉走在艾玛身旁，<br>在她耳边悄悄问道。|#0102Adv05_Narrative013| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:40 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Surprised1

[PrintTextModified Text:欸，米莉亚吗？|#0102Adv05_Ema007| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ＠備考◆こそこそ話風に

[PrintTextModified Text:你觉得她有可能是幕后黑手吗？|#0102Adv05_Sherry007| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:40 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,ArmR6

[PrintTextModified Text:我觉得她一点都不像……|#0102Adv05_Ema008| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ＠備考◆こそこそ話風に

[PrintTextModified Text:可是她一直隐瞒着<br>灵魂是大叔这件事吧。我觉得她很可疑。|#0102Adv05_Sherry008| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:米莉亚正使出浑身解数寻找着监视的死角，<br>而雪莉走到了她身旁。|#0102Adv05_Narrative014| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Normal1,ArmR1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Miria.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:嗯，这里感觉挺不错的……<br>应该能藏在树丛里。|#0102Adv05_Miria005| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:米莉亚。|#0102Adv05_Sherry009| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:嗯？怎么了？|#0102Adv05_Miria006| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:为什么你要和<br>米莉亚交换身体？|#0102Adv05_Sherry010| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ＠備考◆はっと息を呑む

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Miria.Surprised1

[PrintTextModified Text:——！|#0102Adv05_Miria007| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（雪莉！？你问得也太直白了……！）|#0102Adv05_Ema009| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:我真的很好奇嘛。告诉我吧！<br>你为什么要抢走女孩子的身体？|#0102Adv05_Sherry011| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Miria.Pensive1,ArmR8

[PrintTextModified Text:……这个嘛，有很多原因……<br>我不是很想说呢～……啊哈哈～……|#0102Adv05_Miria008| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Miria.Normal1,ArmR2,ArmL2

[PrintTextModified Text:先、先不讲这个，<br>来，我们继续准备越狱计划吧！|#0102Adv05_Miria009| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Miria.Smile1,ArmR2,ArmL2

[PrintTextModified Text:大叔我要鼓足劲继续啦～！<br>啊，好啦，我要去那边看看咯～！|#0102Adv05_Miria010| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:米莉亚像是故意喊给她们听的一样，<br>逃也似的跑掉了。|#0102Adv05_Narrative015| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:雪莉和艾玛<br>看向彼此。|#0102Adv05_Narrative016| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,ArmR3
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:很可疑吧。|#0102Adv05_Sherry012| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:很难说不是。|#0102Adv05_Ema010| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

