[PrintTextModified Text:亚里沙正静静伫立在湖畔。|#0102Adv05_Narrative018| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:亚里沙！<br>真巧，我们正好在找你！|#0102Adv05_Ema011| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HidePrinter
@AnimateActorExtended ActorIds:MainBackground-Front,Alisa-Front Loop:false
