[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛面露笑容，<br>朝亚里沙跑了过去。|#0102Adv05_Narrative019| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:80 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Angry1,Option-ArmL-Off

[PrintTextModified Text:哈啊？|#0102Adv05_Alisa001| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:被亚里沙猛地一瞪，<br>艾玛吓得两腿发软停在原地。|#0102Adv05_Narrative020| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:80 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:"（说、说起来我还没跟亚里沙<br>　和和气气地讲过话……）|#0102Adv05_Ema012|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Angry1,Option-ArmL-Off

[PrintTextModified Text:我和你们没话好说。<br>别过来。|#0102Adv05_Alisa002| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:尤其是苍蝇妹跟大叔。<br>看到你们就不爽。|#0102Adv05_Alisa003| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:雪莉和米莉亚一下子就垂头丧气了起来。|#0102Adv05_Narrative021| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:65 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Pensive1,ArmR19,ArmL14
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:35 IdAndAppearance:Miria.Pensive1,ArmR6,ArmL6

[PrintTextModified Text:至于那么讨厌我吗……|#0102Adv05_Miria011| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:不要叫我苍蝇啦，叫小仙子也好啊……|#0102Adv05_Sherry013| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛将两个靠在一起抱团取暖的人暂时丢到一边，<br>朝亚里沙踏出一步。|#0102Adv05_Narrative022| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1,ArmL1

[PrintTextModified Text:亚里沙，希望你可以助我们一臂之力。<br>我们的越狱计划需要你的力量。|#0102Adv05_Ema013| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Surprised1,Option-ArmL-Off,ArmL2

[PrintTextModified Text:需要我……？|#0102Adv05_Alisa004| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Normal1,ArmR1,ArmL1

[PrintTextModified Text:是的是的！艾玛想到了一个主意！<br>那就是做个【热气球】！|#0102Adv05_Sherry014| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:要想越狱，必须跨过围墙。<br>只要能飞上天空就好说了，可惜汉娜的魔法没法使用。|#0102Adv05_Narrative023| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:但是用热气球的话，也许可以飞上天空。<br>这就是艾玛想出的计划。|#0102Adv05_Narrative024| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1,ArmR1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:80 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Normal1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:20 IdAndAppearance:Miria.Normal1,ArmR1,ArmL1

[PrintTextModified Text:玛格负责筹措布料，<br>汉娜她们负责缝制。|#0102Adv05_Ema014| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:而我们负责寻找升起热气球的地点！|#0102Adv05_Sherry015| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:要是被发现就完了……<br>所以我们得找个离围墙近，并且不太显眼的地方。|#0102Adv05_Miria012| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:嗯。就按照这个分工，我们要一起齐心协力<br>制作热气球。|#0102Adv05_Ema015| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:不过，燃料是个问题……|#0102Adv05_Ema016| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:我就想，如果用你的魔法【点火】的话，<br>说不定能让热气球飘起来。|#0102Adv05_Ema017| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Flushed1,Option-ArmL-Off

[PrintTextModified Text:你们需要我……|#0102Adv05_Alisa005| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:尽管被口罩挡着看不太清楚，<br>但亚里沙的脸颊的确微微泛起了红潮。|#0102Adv05_Narrative025| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:你们需要我……|#0102Adv05_Alisa006| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:她似乎在细细回味<br>艾玛刚才的那番话。|#0102Adv05_Narrative026| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ＠備考◆ひそひそ声で

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:40 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1,ArmR3
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:60 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Normal1,ArmR6

[PrintTextModified Text:一下子就被说动了呢。<br>我感觉她应该很好拿捏耶。|#0102Adv05_Sherry016| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:雪莉对艾玛悄悄说道。<br>艾玛也找到了突破点，便鼓起勇气走近说道。|#0102Adv05_Narrative027| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Flushed1,Option-ArmL-Off
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Determined2,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:……我们需要你，亚里沙！<br>这件事只能由你来做！|#0102Adv05_Ema018| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Flushed1,Option-ArmL-Off,ArmR9

[PrintTextModified Text:……只、只能由我、做……！？|#0102Adv05_Alisa007| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:亚里沙连耳根都在颤抖。|#0102Adv05_Narrative028| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:没错。只有你能做到。<br>我们都在等着你。|#0102Adv05_Ema019| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:都、都在等我……！？|#0102Adv05_Alisa008| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛又向她靠近了一步。|#0102Adv05_Narrative029| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:60 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Determined2,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:拜托你了亚里沙！|#0102Adv05_Ema020| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:20 IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Flushed1,Option-ArmL-Off,ArmR9

[PrintTextModified Text:只不过，亚里沙也顺势<br>向后退了一步，<br>就好像两人之间隔着一堵看不见的墙。|#0102Adv05_Narrative030| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Pensive1,ArmR1

[PrintTextModified Text:咦～……|#0102Adv05_Sherry017| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Flushed1,Option-ArmL-Off,ArmR9

[PrintTextModified Text:……是、是吗……所以你们才来找我啊。|#0102Adv05_Alisa009| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:嗯……如果计划顺利，大家都能离开这里了。<br>希望你能助我们一臂之力。|#0102Adv05_Ema021| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:可是亚里沙却背过身去，<br>似乎有些难堪。|#0102Adv05_Narrative031| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Pensive1,Option-ArmL-Off,ArmR1,ArmL3

[PrintTextModified Text:——放弃吧。<br>找我帮忙只会把事情搞砸。|#0102Adv05_Alisa010| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我做不到，抱歉。|#0102Adv05_Alisa011| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:亚里沙和艾玛擦肩而过，<br>准备离开此处。|#0102Adv05_Narrative032| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Surprised1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:怎么会呢，亚里沙……！<br>你听我说——|#0102Adv05_Ema022| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@StopBgm

[PrintTextModified Text:就在此时。|#0102Adv05_Narrative033| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

