@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Miria.Surprised1,ArmR8,ArmL7

[PrintTextModified Text:咕呀————！！|#0102Adv05_Miria013| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:米莉亚瞬间忘记了淑女修养，不顾脸面放声惨叫，<br>然后抱头鼠窜。|#0102Adv05_Narrative036| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Miria.Fearful1,ArmR8,ArmL7

[PrintTextModified Text:打到我了！！打到我啦啊啊！！<br>要死啦啊啊啊啊啊！！|#0102Adv05_Miria014| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Normal1,ArmR18,ArmL13

[PrintTextModified Text:冷静一点米莉亚！<br>子弹没有射中你！|#0102Adv05_Sherry018| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Surprised1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:是奈叶香！？|#0102Adv05_Ema023| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:看样子，应该是奈叶香<br>正躲在某处狙击。|#0102Adv05_Narrative037| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛立即环视了周遭一圈，<br>但没有发现奈叶香的身影。|#0102Adv05_Narrative038| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Angry1,ArmR3,ArmL7

